# User-supplied media are local inputs, never part of the source distribution.
input/*
!input/README.md
!input/art
input/art/*
!input/art/README.md
**/node_modules/
**/.cache/
**/__pycache__/
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.log
CC/样片/
CC/音频/
CC/发布/
CC/美术生成/
output/
*.mp4
*.mp3
*.flac
*.wav
*.lrc

# Local credentials and certificate/private-key containers.
.npmrc
.pypirc
.netrc
credentials.json
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
